# The medium park tree, two tiles wide. A lobed summer canopy with lit
# clusters on the upper left and a dark underside under each lobe, a bark
# trunk with a root flare, and a soft shadow on the grass. Autumn turns it
# amber; dark drops it a shade for the back of a grove.
sprite park-tree
size 32 48
layer object
footprint 2 1
origin 0 32
tag tree plant park
variant autumn v=y V=Y !=9 J=8
variant dark v=V V=! !=J J=7

frame default
